],null]}]}],["$","$L32","/services/technical-seo/",{"as":"li","index":2,"className":"Sections_numberedItem__zJzfX","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedLink__gg0WT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedIndex__uRgOj","children":"03"}],["$","$L12",null,{"href":"/services/technical-seo/","className":"Sections_numberedTitle__hoVr2","children":"Technical SEO"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedDescription__wBeG3","children":"Crawl, index, performance and structured data problems diagnosed and fixed — the constraints that cap search visibility."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedArrow__E7xJy","aria-hidden":"true","children":"→"}],null]}]}],["$","$L32","/services/answer-engine-optimisation/",{"as":"li","index":3,"className":"Sections_numberedItem__zJzfX","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedLink__gg0WT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedIndex__uRgOj","children":"04"}],["$","$L12",null,{"href":"/services/answer-engine-optimisation/","className":"Sections_numberedTitle__hoVr2","children":"Answer Engine Optimisation (AEO)"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedDescription__wBeG3","children":"Structure content so search and AI systems extract it as the direct answer. Featured snippets, direct answers and AI Overviews."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedArrow__E7xJy","aria-hidden":"true","children":"→"}],null]}]}],["$","$L32","/services/generative-engine-optimisation/",{"as":"li","index":4,"className":"Sections_numberedItem__zJzfX","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedLink__gg0WT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedIndex__uRgOj","children":"05"}],["$","$L12",null,{"href":"/services/generative-engine-optimisation/","className":"Sections_numberedTitle__hoVr2","children":"Generative Engine Optimisation (GEO)"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedDescription__wBeG3","children":"Get cited as a source inside AI-generated answers across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and AI Overviews."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Sections_numberedArrow__E7xJy","aria-hidden":"true","children":"→"}],null]}]}],["$","$L32","/services/ai-optimisation/",{"as":"li","index":5,"className":"Sections_numberedItem__zJzfX","children":"$L33"}],"$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e"]}]]}]}]
2b:["$","section","explainer",{"id":"$undefined","className":"Section_section__vCyY6 Section_lg__MMJQv","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container container--content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"ProseSections_stack__FXqKr","children":[["$","$L3f","What changed, and why rankings stopped being the whole story",{"as":"section","delay":0,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"ProseSections_heading__uxEsC","children":"What changed, and why rankings stopped being the whole story"}],[["$","p","For twenty years, being found meant one thing: a",{"className":"ProseSections_paragraph__Bhwli","children":"For twenty years, being found meant one thing: appearing high in a list of ten blue links. The mechanism was stable enough that an entire industry organised itself around a single metric. That arrangement is now breaking in a specific, measurable way — the query still happens, the result still ranks, and the click does not arrive, because an answer was assembled above it from sources the searcher never had to visit."}],["$","p","This is not the death of search. It is a change ",{"className":"ProseSections_paragraph__Bhwli","children":"This is not the death of search. It is a change in what winning looks like. A business can hold position three for a term and lose most of its traffic on it, while a competitor that never ranked at all gets named inside the summary. The two outcomes are produced by different mechanisms, and optimising harder for the first does nothing for the second."}],["$","p","The practical consequence is that visibility now",{"className":"ProseSections_paragraph__Bhwli","children":"The practical consequence is that visibility now has to be measured on more than one surface. A report that shows rankings and organic sessions describes a shrinking part of the picture, and a business reading only that report will conclude things are fine right up until the quarter they are not."}]],null]}],["$","$L3f","Five surfaces, five different mechanisms",{"as":"section","delay":60,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"ProseSections_heading__uxEsC","children":"Five surfaces, five different mechanisms"}],[["$","p","SEO, AEO, GEO, AIO and SXO get treated as fashio",{"className":"ProseSections_paragraph__Bhwli","children":"SEO, AEO, GEO, AIO and SXO get treated as fashionable relabelling of the same work. They are not. Each names a genuinely different retrieval mechanism, and a business can be strong on one while being completely absent from the next."}],["$","p","Understanding which mechanism is failing is most",{"className":"ProseSections_paragraph__Bhwli","children":"Understanding which mechanism is failing is most of the diagnosis. A site that is technically sound and ranks well but never gets cited in AI answers has a content-shape problem, not a crawl problem. A site AI crawlers cannot render has a foundational problem, and no amount of content work above it will register."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"ProseSections_points__aPDEg","children":[["$","li","Ranked results reward technical health, relevance and authority — position determines whether anyone sees you.",{"className":"ProseSections_point__dPDSv","children":"Ranked results reward technical health, relevance and authority — position determines whether anyone sees you."}],["$","li","Direct answers reward a complete answer stated early, in language that survives being lifted out of its page.",{"className":"ProseSections_point__dPDSv","children":"Direct answers reward a complete answer stated early, in language that survives being lifted out of its page."}],"$L40","$L41","$L42"]}]]}],"$L43","$L44"]}]}]}]
